	(text "UART adapter: 3.3 V logic. Pin 2 is VREF only.\nMCU TX -> adapter RX; MCU RX <- adapter TX.\nHold BOOT, pulse RESET, release BOOT.\nUSB pins unused; program through UART0."
		(at 230 157 0)
